<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Mobil cut to outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Mobil cut to outperform.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Schroder Wertheim said it removed Mobil Corp from its recommended list and cut the rating to outperform.</p>
<p>-- said Mobil is only two percent below the target price of $133 a share.</p>
<p>-- said 1997 earnings estimate of $8.05 a share remains unchanged.</p>
<p>-- Mobil lost 3/4 to 129-1/2.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
